# Production API base for the web app and the desktop (Electron) build.
# Both the AWS-hosted website and the packaged .exe load their JS from here at build time; without
# it the app falls back to http://localhost:4000 (see src/lib/apiClient.ts) and shows
# "Can't reach the server". nginx on the server strips the /api prefix before proxying to the API.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://stock.suraniandsons.com/api
